.github
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
dist
**/dist
build
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
**/.env

docs
deploy
infra
scripts
packages/*/tests
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
Makefile
